{
  "id": "GEN.35",
  "number": "35",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Omochakano 35",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "35",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "35",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo okogenda Beteli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko erimo Nyasae agateebia Yakobo: “Imoka, otiire ogende omenye Beteli, oagachere Nyasae egesasiimero aroro, Nyasae, oyo okoorokerete ekero kware gotama korwa ase Esau momura omino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yakobo agateebia abanto baye amo naabwo bonsi baarenge komo: “Rusia emegwekano y’ebinyasae ebigeni b’ebisaku, ebi mobwate ase egati yaino, mwesibie inwe abanyene, moonchorerie chianga chiaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toimoke totiire gochia Beteli, erinde ing’agachere Nyasae egesasiimero aroro, Nyasae oyonyigwete ekero keria nareenge nobokong’u, akaba amo nainche ase orogendo rwane rwonsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakaa Yakobo emegwekano y’ebinyasae ebigeni bionsi ebio babwate, na ebigera babeegete ase amato abo, na Yakobo akabitindeka inse y’omote okorokwa omwaloni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "oyorenge ang’e na Sekemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero baimogete kogenda orogendo rwabo, okoondokia gokarua ase Nyasae, gokabwata abanto b’emechie eria yabaetanaine; Ase igo tibanyara komonyookia basinto ba Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo amo nabwo bonsi baarenge nere bagaika omochie o Lusu, Omochie oyio naende noro okorokwa Beteli, oyio ore ime y’ense ya Kaanani",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo akaagacha egesasiimero, Akaaroka aase aria Eli‐Beteli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ekiagera agwo nao Nyasae aorokerete Yakobo, ekero areenge gotama korwa ase oyomwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Debora, omoreri o Rebeka, agakwa, agatindekwa inse y’omote okorokwa omwaloni. Aase agwo akarokwa Aloni‐Bakuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio naende Nyasae akaorokera Yakobo, ekero Yakobo areenge korwa Padan‐Aramu, Nyasae akamosesenia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Nyasae akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Erieta riao n’Yakobo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "bono tokorokwa Yakobo naende,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "korende nigo orarokwe Israeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ase igo, akamoroka Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Nyasae akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Inche Nyasae Omobui,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "genderera gosarara, obuche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egesaku na emeganda y’ebisaku nigo erarue asore,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na abarwoti mbarue asore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ense eye naete Aburaamu na Isaka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ninkoyee aye na ororeeria rwao rorache korwa magega yao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Nyasae akaimoka akagenda igoro, akarwa asare, agwo ase areenge gokwana nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo agatenenia rigena buna esiiro aase aria Nyasae akwanerete amo nere, akaumora ekeng’wanso gi’ekenyugwa amo namaguta igoro yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo Yakobo akaaroka aase aria Nyasae akwanerete amo nere Beteli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa kwa Raeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bagachaaka orogendo rwabo korwa Beteli, ekero batigairie orogendo oroke baike Efarati, Raeli agachaaka kobina ase okoibora, akaba nobokong’u bw’okoibora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero areenge koromwa mono, omoiboria akamoteebia: “Toondoka, ekiagera naende nomwana omoisia oraibore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo akaba okogireka ase ogokwa; na ekero areenge ang’e ase ogokwa, Akamoroka omwana oyio Ben‐Oni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", korende ise akamoroka Benjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Raeli agakwa, agatindekwa agwo ase enchera ekogenda Efarati, nao Bethlehemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yakobo agatenenia rigena ri’ekeinyorio ase embeera ya Raeli, nao rire goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Israeli akaimoka, akagenda, agatenenia eema yaye ng’umbu y’omoorobiri o Ederi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abamura ba Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engaki eria Israeli amenyete ase ense eria, Rubeni akagenda akaraara na Bilia, omokungu o ise, oria o sere-sere, na Israeli akaigwa amang’ana ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abamura ba Yakobo nigo baarenge ikomi na babere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana abamura ba Lea nabwo aba: Rubeni, omwana omotangi o Yakobo, na Simioni, na Lawi, na Yuda, na Isakaru, na Sabuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana abamura ba Raeli nabwo Yusufu na Benjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana abamura ba Bilia, omoiseke omosomba o Raeli, nabwo Dani na Nafutali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
